<h3>Production Deployment: DeepSeek-V4</h3>
<p>DSpark replaced MTP-1 (the previous single-token drafter) in DeepSeek-V4-Flash and V4-Pro serving engines. Under live user traffic, at the practically relevant 80 tok/s/user SLA, DSpark improves aggregate throughput by <strong>+51%</strong> (Flash) and <strong>+52%</strong> (Pro). At matched throughput levels, per-user generation speed accelerates by 60–85% (Flash) and 57–78% (Pro). Under strict 120 TPS SLA where MTP-1's capacity degenerates, DSpark maintains robust throughput — effectively shifting the entire Pareto frontier of inference serving outward.</p>

